<title>JAPAN: Takasago to issue 450 mln yen warrant.</title>
<headline>Takasago to issue 450 mln yen warrant.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Takasago Electric</p>
<p>Industry Co Ltd</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Kankaku Securities Co Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE warrant	     ISSUE NO 1	    AMT   450 million yen</p>
<p> COUPON 2.6%		ISS PRICE 100 yen   MATURITY 12.Sep.00</p>
<p>EXERCISE FRM 1.Nov.96  EXERCISE TO 11.Sep.00</p>
<p> LAST MOODY		 PAY DATE 12.Sep.96  NT PAY 12.Mar/Sep</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		   SIGN DATE	     SUB DATE 2-11.Sep</p>
<p> LAST JCR		   LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
</text>
